# Magebane Lizard (official ruling): its ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger, and resolves even if that spell
# is countered. Bot2 casts Lightning Bolt at Bot1: the Lizard's trigger for Bolt is on the stack above it. Bot1 answers with
# Counterspell, which is also a noncreature spell, so a second trigger (about Bot1, its first noncreature spell this turn)
# goes above that. Both resolve first: Bot1 takes 1 (20 -> 19), then Counterspell counters Bolt (Bolt's 3 never arrives), and
# Bot2's trigger still resolves with Bolt gone: Bot2 takes 1 (20 -> 19).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Emerald
Magebane Lizard
Mox Sapphire
Black Lotus
Counterspell
Mountain
Mountain x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Mountain x14

